{"text": "Unable to believe his eyes, he let the paper fall onto his knees without even looking at the number of the ticket. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He felt a pleasant chill in his stomach, as if someone had poured cold water over him, a tingling, terrible, sweet feeling. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Masha, 9, 499 is there, he said in a strange, hollow voice that did not sound like his own. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Masha looked at his astonished, frightened face and understood at once that he was not joking. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> 9, 499, she asked, turning pale and dropping the folded tablecloth back onto the table. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Wait, not yet, he answered when she asked about the ticket number, but anyway, the number of our series is there. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He looked at his wife and gave a broad, foolish smile, like a baby who has just been shown a bright toy. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Masha smiled too, because she was just as glad as he was that he had not looked at the ticket number yet. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It is so sweet and so thrilling to tease yourself with the hope of a fortune that may soon be yours. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> If I had checked the ticket number at once, this sweet moment would have been over in a second, Ivan thought.", "alignment": {"characters": ["U", "n", "a", "b", "l", "e", " ", "t", "o", " ", "b", "e", "l", "i", "e", "v", "e", " ", "h", "i", "s", " ", "e", "y", "e", "s", ",", " ", "h", "e", " ", "l", "e", "t", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "p", "a", "p", "e", "r", " ", "f", "a", "l", "l", " ", "o", "n", "t", "o", " ", "h", "i", "s", " ", "k", "n", "e", "e", "s", " ", "w", "i", "t", "h", "o", "u", "t", " ", "e", "v", "e", "n", " ", "l", "o", "o", "k", "i", "n", "g", " ", "a", "t", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "n", "u", "m", "b", "e", "r", " ", "o", "f", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "t", "i", "c", "k", "e", "t", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "H", "